# Note: post-monorepo-migration (2026-05-16) the following patterns
# moved to the repo-root .gitignore because their targets are now
# outside android/:
#   - .worktrees/  (was at Trails root; stays at monorepo root)
#   - /.claude/settings.local.json  (.claude/ stayed at monorepo root)
#   - /.github/workflows/my.variables, my.secrets  (.github/ at root)
# And /firestore.rules is no longer ignored — moved to firebase/ and
# tracked as the canonical source of truth.
